#gapi/examples/profile is a basic example for [Google People API](https://developers.google.com/people).[Quick Start Guide](https://developers.google.com/people/quickstart/js) explains how to [enable in console](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/library/people.googleapis.com) and create [credentials](https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials) for access.
```js_input
const scope = 'https://www.googleapis.com/auth/userinfo.profile'
const doc = 'https://people.googleapis.com/$discovery/rest'
await gapi.client._auth({ scope: scope, discoveryDocs: doc })
await gapi.client._try(async ({people:{people}})=>{
  // fetch and output user name
  const response = await people.get({
    resourceName: 'people/me',
    personFields: 'names'
  })
  return "Your name is " + response.result.names[0]?.displayName
})
```
