#TensorFlow/examples/linear_regression is the official linear regression tutorial from [TensorFlow CodeLab](https://codelabs.developers.google.com/codelabs/tfjs-training-regression/index.html). We extend the example slightly with L2 regularization, early stopping criteria (to help avoid poor results), and support for WebAssembly (CPU), which can be faster than WebGL (GPU) on smaller problems.
